---
description: Studi UI/UX redesign rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `design/HANDOFF.md` as the visual specification
for all Studi redesign work.

Use the `design/*.dc.html` files as visual references.

Preserve all existing application functionality.

Do not modify:
- Supabase migrations
- Database schemas
- RLS policies
- Authentication logic
- Server actions
- Data-fetching logic
- Business logic

Refactor UI components only when necessary.

Maintain:
- Responsive desktop and mobile layouts
- Light/dark/system appearance
- User-configurable accent colors
- Accessibility
- Existing application routes

Do not remove features just because they are absent
from the design prototype.

Run TypeScript, lint, tests and build after each stage.

Do not commit or push automatically.